			<br/>


<div class="newblue-source"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: bold">Source</span>: ABC News, "\xe2\x80\x99This Week\xe2\x80\x99 Transcript: Ben Carson and Donald Trump,\xe2\x80\x9d abcnews.go.com, Nov. 8, 2015</div></div></div><br style="CLEAR: both"/>


