<div style="WIDTH: 100%; DISPLAY: block"><a name="undocumented-legal-path"></a>

<div class="newblue-question"><a onclick="__gaTracker('send', 'event', 'newblue-2016-position-change', 'Click-position-change-trump', 'newblue-2016-election-position-change-trump-pathway-to-legalization')" href="http://web.archive.org/web/20170118172608/http://2016election.procon.org/view.answers.election.php?questionID=002025#donald-trump">Should Undocumented Immigrants in the United States Be Allowed to Become Legal Residents?</a> </div>

<div class="newblue-con">

