			<br/>


<div class="newblue-source"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: bold">Source</span>: <em>Los Angeles Times </em>staff, "Transcript: Donald Trump's Full Immigration Speech, Annotated,\xe2\x80\x9d latimes.com, Sep. 1, 2016</div></div></div><br style="CLEAR: both"/>


<div class="newblue-nc">

