          <td valign="top" style="padding:0px 10px 0px 10px;">  <div style="display:block; ">   
    <span class="lastupdated-newblue" style="float:right;">Last updated on: 2/6/2015 8:54:19 AM PST</span><br/>
<span class="title-newblue"><strong style="font-size:36px; color:#333; margin:0px; padding:0px; text-align:left;">Should Any Vaccines Be Required for Children?</strong></span>


<br/>


<style type="text/css">
