<div id="header"><div id="hdr"><div><a class="logo" href="http://web.archive.org/web/20160801152353/http://www.lovetoknow.com/">l<u>o</u>ve<b>to</b>know</a> <a id="super" href="http://web.archive.org/web/20160801152353/http://www.lovetoknow.com/family.html">Lifestyle</a> <div id="tools"><form method="get" role="search" class="search" action="/web/20160801152353/http://kids.lovetoknow.com/search/results"><input name="q" placeholder="find advice you can trust" type="search"><input type="submit"></form></div></div></div>
<div class="ad ad-top" id="ad-top-3"></div><ul id="crumbs"><li><a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20160801152353/http://www.lovetoknow.com/">LoveToKnow</a> &raquo;</li><li><a href="http://web.archive.org/web/20160801152353/http://www.lovetoknow.com/family.html">Lifestyle</a> &raquo;</li><li><a href="/web/20160801152353/http://kids.lovetoknow.com/wiki/Main_Page">Kids</a> &raquo;</li><li><a title="kids fashion" href="/web/20160801152353/http://kids.lovetoknow.com/wiki/Category:Kids'_Clothing_and_Hair">Kids' Clothing and Hair</a> &raquo;</li> <li><a href="/web/20160801152353/http://kids.lovetoknow.com/wiki/Pros_and_Cons_of_School_Uniforms">Pros and Cons of School Uniforms</a></li></ul></div>
<div id="page" data-id="55507"><div id="share" class="social share"></div>
<h1>Pros and Cons of School Uniforms</h1><div id="main"><div id="content"><style>.image.left{margin-right:15px;max-width:344px}.image.left img{max-width:342px}</style><div class="image left" style="width: 301px"><a title="teen in school uniform" rel="slideshow" target="_blank" href="/web/20160801152353/http://kids.lovetoknow.com/wiki/Slideshow:School_Uniform_Gallery"><img src="http://web.archive.org/web/20160801152353im_/http://cf.ltkcdn.net/kids/images/std/147335-299x425-kids-uniform-slide.jpg" alt="teen in school uniform"/></a><div class="caption"><a rel="slideshow" href="/web/20160801152353/http://kids.lovetoknow.com/wiki/Slideshow:School_Uniform_Gallery">School Uniform Gallery</a></div></div><div id="byline"><div class="author">By <a rel="author" href="http://web.archive.org/web/20160801152353/http://www.lovetoknow.com/member/78~sarabeth-asaff">Beth Asaff</a></div></div>
<p>Many public school systems across the country are instituting school uniforms in an effort to improve overall school performance and to reduce negative behavior. Standardized school clothing has become a heated national debate with experts taking stands on both sides of the dispute. Below is a summary of the pros and cons of school uniforms.</p>
