                <h2>Let's settle the school uniform debate once and for all</h2>

    <div class="ui-socials clearfix" id="article-social-shares">
        <button class="ui-button facebook" data-share data-track-platform="facebook" href="https://www.facebook.com/sharer/sharer.php?u=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.sheknows.com%2Fparenting%2Farticles%2F809991%2Fthe-pros-and-cons-of-school-uniforms">
