<h1 class="headline__title">Are You For Or Against School Uniforms? Two Fashion Editors Debate</h1>
</div>


<div class="timestamp">
<span class="timestamp__date--published">09/30/2014 12:52 pm ET</span>
</div>

<div class="js-horizontal-share share-bar share-bar--horizontal" data-beacon="{&quot;p&quot;:{&quot;mnid&quot;:&quot;headline_share_bar&quot;}}">
