t/uploads/2016/09/Dorchester-High-School-55x49.jpg" class="attachment-small-post-thumbnail size-small-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="" title="Classroom, ca. 1901" srcset="http://web.archive.org/web/20170126112226im_/https://journalistsresource.org/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/Dorchester-High-School-55x49.jpg 55w, http://web.archive.org/web/20170126112226im_/https://journalistsresource.org/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/Dorchester-High-School-109x100.jpg 109w" sizes="(max-width: 55px) 100vw, 55px"/></a><a class="related_thumb mobile-side" href="http://web.archive.org/web/20170126112226/https://journalistsresource.org/studies/society/education/achievement-gap-student-race-income-research" data-wpel-link="internal"><img width="109" height="100" src="http://web.archive.org/web/20170126112226im_/https://journalistsresource.org/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/Dorchester-High-School-109x100.jpg" class="attachment-rss-post-thumbnail size-rss-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="" title="Classroom, ca. 1901" srcset="http://web.archive.org/web/20170126112226im_/https://journalistsresource.org/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/Dorchester-High-School-109x100.jpg 109w, http://web.archive.org/web/20170126112226im_/https://journalistsresource.org/wp-content/uploads/2016/09/Dorchester-High-School-55x49.jpg 55w" sizes="(max-width: 109px) 100vw, 109px"/></a></li><li class="clear"><a class="invert writeup" href="http://web.archive.org/web/20170126112226/https://journalistsresource.org/studies/society/education/college-sports-how-winning-impacts-revenue" data-wpel-link="internal">College sports: How winning impacts revenue</a><a class="related_thumb wide-side" href="http://web.archive.org/web/20170126112226/https://journalistsresource.org/studies/society/education/college-sports-how-winning-impacts-revenue" data-wpel-link="internal"><img width="55" height="49" src="http://web.archive.org/web/20170126112226im_/https://journalistsresource.org/wp-content/uploads/2015/11/top_athletics-55x49.jpg" class="attachment-small-post-thumbnail size-small-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="" title="top_athletics" srcset="http://web.archive.org/web/20170126112226im_/https://journalistsresource.org/wp-content/uploads/2015/11/top_athletics-55x49.jpg 55w, http://web.archive.org/web/20170126112226im_/https://journalistsresource.org/wp-content/uploads/2015/11/top_athletics-109x100.jpg 109w" sizes="(max-width: 55px) 100vw, 55px"/></a><a class="related_thumb mobile-side" href="http://web.archive.org/web/20170126112226/https://journalistsresource.org/studies/society/education/college-sports-how-winning-impacts-revenue" data-wpel-link="internal"><img width="109" height="100" src="http://web.archive.org/web/20170126112226im_/https://journalistsresource.org/wp-content/uploads/2015/11/top_athletics-109x100.jpg" class="attachment-rss-post-thumbnail size-rss-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="" title="top_athletics" srcset="http://web.archive.org/web/20170126112226im_/https://journalistsresource.org/wp-content/uploads/2015/11/top_athletics-109x100.jpg 109w, http://web.archive.org/web/20170126112226im_/https://journalistsresource.org/wp-content/uploads/2015/11/top_athletics-55x49.jpg 55w" sizes="(max-width: 109px) 100vw, 109px"/></a></li><li class="clear"><a class="invert writeup" href="http://web.archive.org/web/20170126112226/https://journalistsresource.org/studies/society/education/student-learning-laptops-measuring-effectiveness-laptops-american-classrooms" data-wpel-link="internal">Do school laptops help improve student performance?</a><a class="related_thumb wide-side" href="http://web.archive.org/web/20170126112226/https://journalistsresource.org/studies/society/education/student-learning-laptops-measuring-effectiveness-laptops-american-classrooms" data-wpel-link="internal"><img width="55" height="49" src="http://web.archive.org/web/20170126112226im_/https://journalistsresource.org/wp-content/uploads/2016/07/ed.gov_-55x49.jpg" class="attachment-small-post-thumbnail size-small-post-thum